    <section>
      <title>Our Work</title>
      <slide>
        <title>Preview Activity 5.1.1: Handwriting Space</title>
        <p><url href="https://activecalculus.org/single2e/sec-5-1-antid-graphs.html#PA-5-1">Preview Activity 5.1.1 in the book</url></p>
        <p><image source="handwriting-space.png" width="70%"><description>Blank space for handwritten work on Preview Activity 5.1.1, written during class. Typed solution: see the slide titled Typed Solution, Preview Activity 5.1.1, linked below this image.</description></image></p>
        <p>Typed solution: <xref ref="sol-pa-511"/></p>
      </slide>
      <slide xml:id="sol-pa-511">
        <title>Typed Solution: Preview Activity 5.1.1</title>
        <p><ul>
          <li>Draft for your review. The graph given is of <m>f'</m>, with <m>f(0)=1</m>.</li>
          <li>Increasing on <m>(0,\tfrac32)</m> and <m>(4,6)</m>; decreasing on <m>(\tfrac32,4)</m>; constant for <m>x\le 0</m> and <m>x\ge 6</m>.</li>
          <li>Concave up on <m>(0,1)</m> and <m>(3,5)</m>; concave down on <m>(1,3)</m> and <m>(5,6)</m>.</li>
          <li>Relative maximum at <m>x=\tfrac32</m>; relative minimum at <m>x=4</m>.</li>
          <li><m>f(1)=\tfrac32,\ f(2)=\tfrac32,\ f(3)=-\tfrac12,\ f(4)=-2,\ f(5)=-\tfrac12,\ f(6)=1</m>.</li>
        </ul></p>
      </slide>
    </section>
